				<name>TAC 300 - CMYK and ICC CMYK - preserve spots</name>
				<comment>DeviceLink ISO Coated v2 300 percent for calibrated and uncalibrated CMYK. Excludes spot colors, RGB, and soft masks. Verify final ink coverage and ICC condition.</comment>
				<flags user_units="1" scope="16" edit="1" visible="1"></flags>
				<creation>D:20261120013356+02&apos;00&apos;</creation>
